  "titleEn": "Powers of One",
  "titleEs": "Potencias de uno",
  "titleText": {
    "es": "Es algo zen cuando piensas en ello, si no piensas mucho.",
    "en": "It is somewhat Zen when you think about it, if you do not think too much."
